{"id":"0e734c6827b2426f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermEnv.md","title":"PolyTermEnv","display":"PolyTermEnv","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyTermEnv","parameters":["D","ap","d","rho","g","e"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyTermEnv"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>ap</span><span>d</span><span>rho</span><span>g</span><span>e</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 固定组合代数与 PER 语义。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>ap</code>、<code>d</code>、<code>rho</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>e</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyTermEnv D ap d rho g e)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ PolyCtx d g)\n  (and\n    (@ PolyTypeEnv D d rho)\n    (exists n\n      (and\n        (@ Seq g n)\n        (and\n          (@ SeqTo e n D)\n          (forall i\n            (implies\n              (in i n)\n              (exists a\n                (exists x\n                  (exists R (and (@ App g i a) (and (@ App e i x) (and (@ PolyInterpret D ap d rho a R) (@ Edge R x x))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c50c8794e300e443\" href=\"?note=c50c8794e300e443\" title=\"ZFC_PolyCtx\">PolyCtx</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fbb6c80f258d8724\" href=\"?note=fbb6c80f258d8724\" title=\"ZFC_PolyInterpret\">PolyInterpret</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"294a0279fb052c72\" href=\"?note=294a0279fb052c72\" title=\"ZFC_PolyTypeEnv\">PolyTypeEnv</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"572634b8affcd095\" href=\"?note=572634b8affcd095\" title=\"ZFC_SeqTo\">SeqTo</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyTermEnv D ap d rho g e)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_PolyCtx|PolyCtx]]；[[ZFC_PolyInterpret|PolyInterpret]]；[[ZFC_PolyTypeEnv|PolyTypeEnv]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_SeqTo|SeqTo]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Edge","status":"resolved","id":"abaf67a121eca170","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_PolyCtx|PolyCtx]]；[[ZFC_PolyInterpret|PolyInterpret]]；[[ZFC_PolyTypeEnv|PolyTypeEnv]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_SeqTo|SeqTo]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PolyCtx","status":"resolved","id":"c50c8794e300e443","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接